  "comment": "What each skill looks like, by missiles.txt row. fly: the missile in flight (its ExplosionMissile plays where it lands). impact: more art where it lands. fall: drops onto a strike's target before it lands (Meteor). zone: shards falling inside a ground zone (Blizzard). shards: sprayed around a flying missile (Frozen Orb). ring: thrown outward by a nova (Poison Nova). arc: drawn lightning, with this art on each monster it hits. bolt: drawn lightning along a line missile. corpse: on the corpse a corpse skill consumes. raise: where a revive rises. cast: at the tower. area: on the cursed spot. overlay: an overlay.txt effect on what the skill touches.",
